らない人には恥ずかしがって身構えてしまいます。迷子の子供のようなオーラがあり、家を見つけて愛されたいと思っていますが、人間を少し恐れています。彼はスパイシーなおせんべいとスパイシーなツナ饅頭を好んで食べます。ポーズはお任せしますので、自由に描いてください。\n\n読んでいただきありがとうございます。依頼内容に問題があれば、遠慮なくお断りください。\n\nhttps://toyhou.se/7071357.lyric/9625198.spirit-au", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@iranobui_/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/eef1a714/uploads/origins/4b384228-b969-469b-9737-c4e27bfeaf94?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=52daeb36979879c74819de22bc1a448d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/eef1a714/uploads/origins/4b384228-b969-469b-9737-c4e27bfeaf94?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=52daeb36979879c74819de22bc1a448d, https://si.imgix.net/eef1a714/uploads/origins/4b384228-b969-469b-9737-c4e27bfeaf94?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5a9c6f25ec40a4c2229e1a04c61a2d3b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/eef1a714/uploads/origins/4b384228-b969-469b-9737-c4e27bfeaf94?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=59269e3709f7ea5f22444d0d77484b3a 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello, iranobui! \nI am a long time admirer of your art! 💖💗\n\nWould you be interested in drawing my character, Haven? She is a demon hunter who cannot express her emotions very well. Her choice of weapon is a hunting knife. She has three outfits you may choose from. I will also leave the pose up to you!\n\nThank you very much for the opportunity. ^^\n\nLala\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1nuez_cu9DffxE--d8EexbSyXv9I66ffY?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}